# s55 - WHAT MUST NEVER REACH THIS PUBLIC REPO.
# The Worker source is pasted into the Cloudflare dashboard by hand and is not a repo
# file (SSA.1). The commercial briefs are the owner's pricing and positioning - kept on
# disk and in the private Hunt-backups repo instead. _to_delete/ is a staging area
# because the file bridge cannot delete; nothing in it is a source of record.
worker-v2_6_*.js
worker-v2_*.js
docs-private/
_to_delete/
# s57: local record of which build the battery last passed on (ship.cmd GATE 3).
# Machine-local evidence, not a source of record - it must not travel between clones.
test/.last-battery
# s58: SOURCE ART AND SCRATCH PREVIEWS STAY OUT OF THE PUBLIC REPO.
# art/ was taken out of the tree at s56 (SS88) but was never ignored, so re-creating it
# would have put 17 MB of source PNGs back in - `ship` runs `git add -A`. The delivered
# artwork travels base64 inside index.html; art/ is the working source and belongs on
# disk and in Hunt-backups only.
art/
_preview-*.html
_diagram-*.png

# s66: one run's evidence, not a repo file - Claude reads it from the folder.
test/.last-battery.log
test/.shipped.html
